Template specialisations and inline definitions whose emission MWCC and
clang decide differently. Explicit specialisations used before their
definition are declared first (J3DSaverList/J3DSaverLink, setMaterialAnmTev,
TPosition3::makeRotate), stParticle.cpp instantiates TRotation3::setRotate
for the units that only see its declaration, and `inline` definitions that
the decomp places in a .cpp so MWCC emits them weak lose the `inline` so
clang emits them at all (J3DTexNoAnm, PermissionCounter, getKartHitList).

